+# Wire Format Policy
+
+Nothing is currently recorded in this project regarding a decision on the wire serialisation format; the codebase and documentation support multiple rendering formats (including JSON, XML, YAML, TOML, ProtoBuf, and MsgPack) as available features rather than as the product of a single recorded policy decision.
